# {{agentName}} — A2A agent

Generated by genproj (`pydantic-agent`). This is a [Pydantic AI](https://ai.pydantic.dev/)
agent served over the [A2A protocol](https://a2a-protocol.org/) by
[FastA2A](https://github.com/pydantic/fasta2a).

